</section><section class="section-wrap section-space" aria-labelledby="next-title"><div class="section-heading"><h2 id="next-title">What happens after you enquire</h2></div><ol class="steps steps-three"><li><span class="list-number">1</span><h3>We get in touch</h3><p>The team responds through the channel you use to enquire.</p></li><li><span class="list-number">2</span><h3>We understand what you need</h3><p>A few questions about what is on your mind, and what you have tried.</p></li><li><span class="list-number">3</span><h3>We suggest the next step</h3><p>The right consultation or the program, with fees and availability.</p></li></ol></section><section class="faq-wrap has-backdrop" aria-labelledby="faq-title"><svg class="backdrop backdrop-vastu " viewBox="0 0 300 300" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><rect x="30" y="30" width="240" height="240" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" vector-effect="non-scaling-stroke" stroke-width="1.1"></rect><path d="M56.66666666666667 30V270M30 56.66666666666667H270M83.33333333333334 30V270M30 83.33333333333334H270M110 30V270M30 110H270M136.66666666666669 30V270M30 136.66666666666669H270M163.33333333333334 30V270M30 163.33333333333334H270M190 30V270M30 190H270M216.66666666666669 30V270M30 216.66666666666669H270M243.33333333333334 30V270M30 243.33333333333334H270" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" vector-effect="non-scaling-stroke" stroke-width="0.7" class="sky-faint"></path><rect x="110" y="110" width="80" height="80" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" vector-effect="non-scaling-stroke" stroke-width="1.1"></rect><circle cx="150" cy="150" r="4" class="sky-ink"></circle><text x="150" y="14" class="sky-direction" text-anchor="middle" dominant-baseline="central">N</text><text x="282" y="18" class="sky-direction" text-anchor="middle" dominant-baseline="central">NE</text><text x="288" y="150" class="sky-direction" text-anchor="middle" dominant-baseline="central">E</text><text x="282" y="284" class="sky-direction" text-anchor="middle" dominant-baseline="central">SE</text><text x="150" y="288" class="sky-direction" text-anchor="middle" dominant-baseline="central">S</text><text x="18" y="284" class="sky-direction" text-anchor="middle" dominant-baseline="central">SW</text><text x="12" y="150" class="sky-direction" text-anchor="middle" dominant-baseline="central">W</text><text x="18" y="18" class="sky-direction" text-anchor="middle" dominant-baseline="central">NW</text></svg><div class="faq section-wrap section-space" id="faq"><div class="faq-intro"><h2 id="faq-title">Before you write</h2><p>A few practical questions, before you share your details.</p><a href="/contact/" class="text-link" data-enquiry="" data-source="contact-faq" aria-haspopup="dialog">Ask something else</a></div><div class="faq-list"><details><summary>Who sees my details?<span aria-hidden="true"></span></summary><p>WhatsApp and email handle the messages you send through them. This website does not save the details you enter in its WhatsApp enquiry flow. Please avoid sending medical records or other sensitive documents in an initial enquiry.</p></details><details><summary>Can I enquire from outside India?<span aria-hidden="true"></span></summary><p>Yes. Message on WhatsApp or email and mention your country and time zone.</p></details><details><summary>What are the consultation and program fees?<span aria-hidden="true"></span></summary><p>Please ask for the current fees when you enquire. The consultation and the program lasting six months are separate options. The team explains the scope and fee before you decide.</p></details><details><summary>Will I be pushed to buy a remedy?<span aria-hidden="true"></span></summary><p>No. In her words: “It is not a business of fear.” Where a remedy can help she explains why, and the decision stays with you.</p></details></div></div></section><!--$--><!--/$--></main><footer class="site-footer" id="site-footer"><div class="section-wrap"><div class="footer-cta-box"><div class="footer-cta-text"><h2>Start w